  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>Set up Element on your phone and connect it to your unit's Matrix home server. This guide uses Element Classic, but the steps are similar in almost any Matrix application. Takes about five minutes.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Welcome to Matrix",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>This guide uses the Element Classic application, but you can use almost any Matrix application — the steps are similar elsewhere too.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/5239bfbb830a52b8.webp",
              "width": 1918,
              "height": 1113
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Prerequisites",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Copy the home server address (1). You can return to this guide at any time from the bottom-right corner (2).</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/fce8ba119e6c9bf8.webp",
              "width": 6013,
              "height": 3525
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Sign in to Element Classic",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Open Element and select <strong>Sign in</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/d3d387ad950f47e2.webp",
              "width": 2880,
              "height": 1820
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Edit the home server",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Press <strong>Edit</strong> next to the home server address.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/e149492ede84d08b.webp",
              "width": 2880,
              "height": 1820
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Paste the server address",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Paste the server address you copied earlier, then press <strong>Next</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/71fb6f7a4d40f83a.webp",
              "width": 2880,
              "height": 1820
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Authenticate with Keycloak",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Press <strong>Continue with Keycloak</strong>. Continue in your browser, which should prompt for your mTLS certificate — authenticate with your mTLS certificate.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/8f1288ca414bd9ba.webp",
              "width": 2880,
              "height": 1820
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Element Classic home view",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>You are now logged in and can use Matrix. Search for users and rooms from the top-right corner (1), and start a conversation from the bottom-right corner (2).</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/d324ea41bfd3cea3.webp",
              "width": 2880,
              "height": 1820
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
